"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●数学の教師ってどういう風に写ってますか？\n怖い人が多かった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18日は4つめのカレーパン食べたﾖｰﾖｰ( ･_･)/-------◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/02/19/8316274/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眼鏡とクッキー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーれだの図は\n9割みなさん正解でしたせいらりんです！！\nばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7112":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9358452/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パルコ公演、終わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演を通し、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分自身すこしだけでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長したんじゃないかなと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって公演が毎日あることで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー同士話し合ったりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より一層、団結することができたと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、投票により16名が2幕に出れるというシステム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜は、一度も入れませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、悔しかったけれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日毎日、悩んで悩んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","